   "caption": {
    "en": "Going to Chandannagar for Jagaddhatri Puja 2026 from Kolkata? Three things first 🚆\n\n1. Chandannagar is on the Howrah to Bandel suburban railway line.\n2. Trains and roads get very crowded, so travel early in the evening.\n3. Plan your return before you set out, especially if you'll be out late, and check local transport and police advisories.\n\nJagaddhatri Navami is on Thursday 19 November by Drik Panchang's Kolkata calendar (some calendars say 18 November). Photos from 2024. The full guide is on pujoparikramaguide.in.\n\nWho are you going with? Tag them in the comments 👇",
